Package: rbuddy
Title: AI Study Buddy Add-in for RStudio
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("R Buddy", "User", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "nobody@example.com")
Description: An RStudio add-in that reads the script you are writing and your
    recent Console output, suggests analyses you may need, and offers a small
    chat pane backed by local open-source models (Ollama), Gemini, Claude
    (Anthropic API) or any OpenAI-compatible server. Answers can insert R code
    or proofs into your script, or edit lines you got wrong.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: shiny, httr2, jsonlite, rstudioapi, callr, later, commonmark,
    httpuv, htmltools, tools, utils
